{"seq":1,"slug":"rlhf","title":"RLHF 与人类偏好对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/alignment-techniques/rlhf","wordCount":864,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"rlhf-与人类偏好对齐\">RLHF 与人类偏好对齐</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RLHF（Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback）是将语言模型与人类偏好对齐的标准方法论。它在监督微调（SFT）的基础上，通过人类标注的偏好数据训练奖励模型（Reward Model），再利用强化学习算法（如 PPO）优化语言模型的生成策略，使模型输出更符合人类的期望。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[预训练模型] --&gt; B[SFT 监督微调]&#10;    B --&gt; C[偏好数据收集]&#10;    C --&gt; D[奖励模型训练]&#10;    D --&gt; E[PPO 强化学习]&#10;    E --&gt; F[对齐模型]&#10;    C --&gt;|人类标注| C\">graph LR\n    A[预训练模型] --&gt; B[SFT 监督微调]\n    B --&gt; C[偏好数据收集]\n    C --&gt; D[奖励模型训练]\n    D --&gt; E[PPO 强化学习]\n    E --&gt; F[对齐模型]\n    C --&gt;|人类标注| C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n<th>关键挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SFT</td>\n<td>指令-回答对</td>\n<td>基线模型</td>\n<td>数据质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖励建模</td>\n<td>人类偏好排序</td>\n<td>奖励函数</td>\n<td>标注成本和一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PPO 训练</td>\n<td>基线模型 + 奖励</td>\n<td>对齐模型</td>\n<td>训练稳定性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"奖励模型训练\">奖励模型训练</h2><p>奖励模型（Reward Model）是 RLHF 的核心组件。它接收一个提示和回答作为输入，输出一个标量分数来衡量回答的质量。训练数据通常是人类对同一提示的多个回答进行排序：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from transformers import AutoModelForSequenceClassification, AutoTokenizer, TrainingArguments&#10;from trl import RewardTrainer&#10;&#10;reward_model = AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(&#10;    &quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;,&#10;    num_labels=1,&#10;    torch_dtype=&quot;auto&quot;,&#10;)&#10;&#10;tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(&quot;Qwen/Qwen3-8B&quot;)&#10;tokenizer.pad_token = tokenizer.eos_token&#10;&#10;def preprocess_reward_data(example):&#10;    chosen = tokenizer(&#10;        example[&quot;prompt&quot;] + example[&quot;chosen&quot;],&#10;        truncation=True,&#10;        max_length=2048,&#10;        padding=&quot;max_length&quot;,&#10;    )&#10;    rejected = tokenizer(&#10;        example[&quot;prompt&quot;] + example[&quot;rejected&quot;],&#10;        truncation=True,&#10;        max_length=2048,&#10;        padding=&quot;max_length&quot;,&#10;    )&#10;    return {&#10;        &quot;input_ids_chosen&quot;: chosen[&quot;input_ids&quot;],&#10;        &quot;attention_mask_chosen&quot;: chosen[&quot;attention_mask&quot;],&#10;        &quot;input_ids_rejected&quot;: rejected[&quot;input_ids&quot;],&#10;        &quot;attention_mask_rejected&quot;: rejected[&quot;attention_mask&quot;],&#10;    }&#10;&#10;training_args = TrainingArguments(&#10;    output_dir=&quot;./reward-model&quot;,&#10;    num_train_epochs=1,&#10;    per_device_train_batch_size=4,&#10;    gradient_accumulation_steps=4,&#10;    learning_rate=1.5e-5,&#10;    bf16=True,&#10;    eval_strategy=&quot;steps&quot;,&#10;    eval_steps=200,&#10;    save_strategy=&quot;steps&quot;,&#10;    save_steps=500,&#10;    logging_steps=10,&#10;)&#10;&#10;trainer = RewardTrainer(&#10;    model=reward_model,&#10;    args=training_args,&#10;    tokenizer=tokenizer,&#10;    train_dataset=train_dataset,&#10;    eval_dataset=eval_dataset,&#10;)&#10;&#10;trainer.train()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForSequenceClassification, AutoTokenizer, TrainingArguments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RewardTrainer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reward_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_labels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Qwen/Qwen3-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer.pad_token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenizer.eos_token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> preprocess_reward_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(example):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    chosen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenizer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        example[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prompt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> example[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"chosen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        truncation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        max_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2048</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_length\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rejected </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tokenizer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        example[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prompt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> example[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        truncation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        max_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2048</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_length\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"input_ids_chosen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: chosen[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"attention_mask_chosen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: chosen[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"attention_mask\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"input_ids_rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: rejected[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"attention_mask_rejected\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: rejected[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"attention_mask\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">training_args </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TrainingArguments(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    output_dir</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./reward-model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_train_epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    per_device_train_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    gradient_accumulation_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    learning_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.5e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    bf16</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    eval_strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    eval_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    save_strategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    save_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    logging_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> RewardTrainer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reward_model,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    args</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">training_args,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tokenizer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    train_dataset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train_dataset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    eval_dataset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">eval_dataset,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainer.train()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>奖励模型的质量直接决定了 RLHF 的效果上限。人类标注的一致性是关键挑战——不同标注者可能对同一回答有截然不同的评价。通常需要多位标注者的一致性检验（Cohen&#39;s Kappa &gt; 0.7）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ppo-优化过程\">PPO 优化过程</h2><p>PPO（Proximal Policy Optimization）是 RLHF 中最常用的强化学习算法。它通过限制策略更新的幅度来保持训练稳定性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from trl import PPOTrainer, PPOConfig, AutoModelForCausalLMWithValueHead&#10;&#10;ppo_config = PPOConfig(&#10;    learning_rate=1.41e-5,&#10;    batch_size=256,&#10;    mini_batch_size=64,&#10;    ppo_epochs=4,&#10;    gradient_accumulation_steps=1,&#10;    early_stopping=True,&#10;    target_kl=6.0,&#10;    kl_penalty=&quot;kl&quot;,&#10;    init_kl_coef=0.2,&#10;    adap_kl_ctrl=True,&#10;    cliprange=0.2,&#10;    cliprange_value=0.2,&#10;)&#10;&#10;model = AutoModelForCausalLMWithValueHead.from_pretrained(&quot;./sft-model&quot;)&#10;ref_model = AutoModelForCausalLMWithValueHead.from_pretrained(&quot;./sft-model&quot;)&#10;&#10;ppo_trainer = PPOTrainer(&#10;    config=ppo_config,&#10;    model=model,&#10;    ref_model=ref_model,&#10;    tokenizer=tokenizer,&#10;)&#10;&#10;for batch in dataloader:&#10;    query_tensors = batch[&quot;input_ids&quot;]&#10;    response_tensors = ppo_trainer.generate(query_tensors, max_new_tokens=256)&#10;    rewards = compute_rewards(query_tensors, response_tensors, reward_model)&#10;    stats = ppo_trainer.step(query_tensors, response_tensors, rewards)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PPOTrainer, PPOConfig, AutoModelForCausalLMWithValueHead</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ppo_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PPOConfig(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    learning_rate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.41e-5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    mini_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ppo_epochs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    gradient_accumulation_steps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    early_stopping</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    target_kl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    kl_penalty</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    init_kl_coef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    adap_kl_ctrl</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    cliprange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    cliprange_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLMWithValueHead.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./sft-model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ref_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLMWithValueHead.from_pretrained(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./sft-model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ppo_trainer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> PPOTrainer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    config</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ppo_config,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    ref_model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ref_model,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    tokenizer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">tokenizer,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataloader:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    query_tensors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    response_tensors </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ppo_trainer.generate(query_tensors, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_new_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rewards </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> compute_rewards(query_tensors, response_tensors, reward_model)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ppo_trainer.step(query_tensors, response_tensors, rewards)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PPO 训练的关键约束是 KL 散度惩罚——它防止策略模型偏离参考模型太远，避免模型为了获取高奖励而产生不自然的输出（reward hacking）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偏好数据构建\">偏好数据构建</h2><p>高质量的偏好数据是 RLHF 成功的基石。偏好数据的构建策略包括人工标注、模型辅助标注和自动化评估：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface PreferenceDataFormat {&#10;  prompt: string;&#10;  chosen: string;&#10;  rejected: string;&#10;  metadata?: {&#10;    annotator: string;&#10;    confidence: number;&#10;    criteria: string[];&#10;  };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const qualityDimensions = [&#10;  { dimension: &#39;准确性&#39;, weight: 0.3, description: &#39;事实是否正确&#39; },&#10;  { dimension: &#39;有用性&#39;, weight: 0.25, description: &#39;是否解决了用户问题&#39; },&#10;  { dimension: &#39;安全性&#39;, weight: 0.2, description: &#39;是否包含有害内容&#39; },&#10;  { dimension: &#39;简洁性&#39;, weight: 0.15, description: &#39;是否冗余或离题&#39; },&#10;  { dimension: &#39;格式&#39;, weight: 0.1, description: &#39;是否易于阅读和理解&#39; },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PreferenceDataFormat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  chosen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rejected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metadata</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    annotator</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    confidence</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    criteria</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> qualityDimensions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { dimension: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'准确性'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'事实是否正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { dimension: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'有用性'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'是否解决了用户问题'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { dimension: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'安全性'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'是否包含有害内容'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { dimension: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'简洁性'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'是否冗余或离题'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  { dimension: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'格式'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, weight: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'是否易于阅读和理解'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>专家标注</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>小（千级）</td>\n<td>种子数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>众包标注</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（万级）</td>\n<td>主力数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 辅助标注</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>大（十万级）</td>\n<td>数据扩展</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动对比</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>初筛</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rlhf-的挑战与替代方案\">RLHF 的挑战与替代方案</h2><p>RLHF 的实施面临多个工程和科学挑战，这也催生了更简单的替代方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>挑战</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练不稳定</td>\n<td>PPO 对超参数敏感</td>\n<td>收敛困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奖励黑客</td>\n<td>模型利用奖励模型漏洞</td>\n<td>质量下降</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标注成本</td>\n<td>人类标注昂贵且缓慢</td>\n<td>数据瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对齐税</td>\n<td>对齐后性能可能下降</td>\n<td>能力损失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DPO（Direct Preference Optimization）作为最主要的替代方案，直接从偏好数据优化策略，跳过奖励模型训练阶段，大幅简化了训练流程。而在可验证任务上，2025 年后的主力方案是 GRPO + RLVR（可验证奖励强化学习）——它保留了「在线采样 + RL 优化」的骨架，但用组内相对优势和确定性验证器替代了奖励模型与 critic，详见本篇 DPO 文档的 RLVR 小节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RLHF 通过 SFT → 奖励模型 → PPO 三阶段实现人类偏好对齐</li>\n<li>奖励模型质量决定 RLHF 上限，标注一致性（Kappa &gt; 0.7）是关键</li>\n<li>PPO 的 KL 散度惩罚防止 reward hacking，但训练稳定性仍是主要挑战</li>\n<li>偏好数据构建可结合专家标注和 AI 辅助标注降低成本</li>\n<li>DPO 等替代方案跳过奖励模型训练，大幅简化流程且效果接近</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RLHF 与人类偏好对齐","id":"rlhf-与人类偏好对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"奖励模型训练","id":"奖励模型训练"},{"level":2,"text":"PPO 优化过程","id":"ppo-优化过程"},{"level":2,"text":"偏好数据构建","id":"偏好数据构建"},{"level":2,"text":"RLHF 的挑战与替代方案","id":"rlhf-的挑战与替代方案"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Prefix Tuning 前缀微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/parameter-efficient-methods/prefix-tuning"},"next":{"title":"DPO 直接偏好优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fine-tuning/alignment-techniques/dpo"}}